  m_text: "<size=19>\n-  Prime Bucks Gamble Wheel begins when player chooses to Gamble
    from the Prime Bucks feature.\n\n-  Gamble Wheel will determine if the player
    can multiply the total credit prize to win even bigger.\n\n      -  If player
    wins, the total credit prize is multiplied by the gamble multiplier from Base
    Game.\n\n      -  If player loses, the original credit prize is awarded.\n\n-
    \ The gamble multiplier in base game is reset once the gamble feature ends."
